: addresses
: Test the IPv4 and IPv6 endpoints of both protocols
:
$* <<EOI >>EOO
tcp 127.0.0.1 3074
udp 192.0.2.1 3075
tcp ::1 443
udp fe80::1 0
EOI
127.0.0.1:3074
192.0.2.1:3075
[::1]:443
[fe80::1]:0
EOO

: specification
: Test the format specification applying to the whole endpoint
:
$* <<EOI >>EOO
tcp 127.0.0.1 3074 >16
tcp ::1 443 *<12
EOI
